IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pspm-dealers`

-- Precious Stones and Precious Metals (Prevention of Money Laundering, Terrorism Financing and Proliferation Financing) Act 2019, ss 2, 6, 8, 9A, 10, 11, 13, 15-17, 27, 28, 31 and the Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
